# Phase 5 - UI Policy Actions

## UI Policy

Short Description:
Make Resolution Fields Mandatory

Table:
Incident [incident]

Condition:
State is Resolved

Active:
Yes

Reverse if false:
Yes


## UI Policy Action 1

Field:
Resolution notes

Mandatory:
True

Visible:
True

Disabled:
False


## UI Policy Action 2

Field:
